BOHOL’s premium baijiu vending machine is a configurable self-service retail cabinet for packaged baijiu, liquor gift boxes and other approved premium beverages. It combines illuminated glass presentation, touchscreen product browsing, flexible shelf layouts and configurable payment integration. For alcohol projects, the final age-verification, sales, labeling and placement requirements must be confirmed for the target market before production and deployment.

For an accurate quotation, send BOHOL product dimensions, packaging photos, target country, venue type, payment method, verification workflow, branding direction and estimated quantity. The engineering team can then review product fit, dispensing protection, cabinet graphics, interface and acceptance testing.
